SELECT , CASE p.status WHEN 0 THEN '待支付' WHEN 1 THEN '处理中' WHEN 2 THEN '支付成功' WHEN 3 THEN '支付失败' WHEN 4 THEN '已取消' WHEN 5 THEN '退款中' WHEN 6 THEN '已退款' ELSE '未知' END AS status_desc, CASE p.pay_type WHEN 0 THEN '余额支付' WHEN 1 THEN '支付宝' WHEN 2 THEN '微信支付' ELSE '其他' END AS pay_type_desc, u.username FROM tb_payment p LEFT JOIN tb_user u ON p.user_id = u.user_id WHERE p.user_id = #{userId}
AND p.status = #{status}
ORDER BY p.create_time DESC

SELECT , CASE p.status WHEN 0 THEN '待支付' WHEN 1 THEN '处理中' WHEN 2 THEN '支付成功' WHEN 3 THEN '支付失败' WHEN 4 THEN '已取消' WHEN 5 THEN '退款中' WHEN 6 THEN '已退款' ELSE '未知' END AS status_desc, CASE p.pay_type WHEN 0 THEN '余额支付' WHEN 1 THEN '支付宝' WHEN 2 THEN '微信支付' ELSE '其他' END AS pay_type_desc, u.username FROM tb_payment p LEFT JOIN tb_user u ON p.user_id = u.user_id
AND p.user_id = #{userId}
AND p.status = #{status}
AND p.create_time >= #{startTime}
AND p.create_time <= #{endTime}
ORDER BY p.create_time DESC
